---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Colton"
  description="Meet Colton Donkersgoed, AI software developer at Kinaxis, gamer, modder, and creator of Great Coltini Industries."
  active="about"
>
  <header class="page-title">
    <span class="eyebrow">BEHIND THE COLLECTION</span>
    <h1>Player first. Builder always.</h1>
  </header>
  <div class="about-layout">
    <section class="profile-panel">
      <div class="profile-monogram" aria-hidden="true">
        CD
      </div>
      <span class="eyebrow">MEET THE MAKER</span>
      <h2>Colton Donkersgoed</h2>
      <p>
        AI software developer
        <br />
        Gamer & modder
      </p>
      <a class="email-link" href="mailto:coltonmdonk@gmail.com">
        <Icon name="mail" />
        coltonmdonk@gmail.com
      </a>
    </section>
    <section class="about-story prose">
      <h2>
        A love of games.
        <br />A habit of making things.
      </h2>
      <p>
        I’m Colton Donkersgoed, an AI software developer at Kinaxis and a
        lifelong gaming enthusiast. I create games, apps, and mods, often
        starting with something I want to use myself.
      </p>
      <p>
        Modding lets me configure the games I love around the way I like to
        play. I’ve also reached Master rank in League of Legends.
      </p>
      <p>
        Great Coltini Industries is where I bring those personal projects
        together.
      </p>
      <div class="about-facts">
        <div>
          <Icon name="games" />
          <h3>Made for the love of it</h3>
          <p>These projects start with something I want to explore.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <Icon name="mods" />
          <h3>Room to make it my own</h3>
          <p>Mods start with a change I want to play with.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a class="button" href="mailto:coltonmdonk@gmail.com">
        Let’s talk <Icon name="arrow" />
      </a>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
